flowchart TD
    A[Define the question] --> B[Set input and environment boundaries]
    B --> C[Inspect files and assumptions]
    C --> D[Choose one small change]
    D --> E[Run the change]
    E --> F[Inspect direct evidence]
    F --> G{Evidence supports the task?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Record result and limitations]
    G -->|No| I[Preserve evidence and revert]
    I --> C